生桂陽簡王融。懿及融，齊永元中爲東昏所害；敷、暢，建武中卒：高祖踐阼，並追封郡王。陳太妃生臨川靖惠王宏，南平元襄王偉。吳太妃生安成康王秀，始興忠武王憺。費太妃生鄱陽忠烈王恢。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0006"}],"interpretation_note":"本前言共同死亡句明及此人；中為範圍原詞，未擇一數字年、不添月日，也不移用追封年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0009","kind":"person","start":108,"end":112,"surface":"衡陽王暢","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"chang","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0012","kind":"person","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"暢","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"chang","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0013","kind":"person","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"暢","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"chang","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0006","kind":"person","start":25,"end":30,"surface":"衡陽宣王暢","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"chang","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0013","kind":"person","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"暢","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"chang","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-liang022-taizu-ten-sons-chang-father","subject_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_A","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"太祖十男","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-022","source_id":"s-liangshu-022-current-rendered-shunzhi-sons-preface","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001","quote":"太祖十男。張皇后生長沙宣武王懿、永陽昭王敷、高祖、衡陽宣王暢。李太妃生桂陽簡王融。懿及融，齊永元中爲東昏所害；敷、暢，建武中卒：高祖踐阼，並追封郡王。陳太妃生臨川靖惠王宏，南平元襄王偉。吳太妃生安成康王秀，始興忠武王憺。費太妃生鄱陽忠烈王恢。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0006","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"完整同段太祖十男標題及逐母生子分組；不將生育、夫妻或排行互相替代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-liang022-taizu-ten-sons-chang-mother","subject_person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AE","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"yqa_yp9_f85","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"張皇后生長沙宣武王懿、永陽昭王敷、高祖、衡陽宣王暢。"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-022","source_id":"s-liangshu-022-current-rendered-shunzhi-sons-preface","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001","quote":"太祖十男。張皇后生長沙宣武王懿、永陽昭王敷、高祖、衡陽宣王暢。李太妃生桂陽簡王融。懿及融，齊永元中爲東昏所害；敷、暢，建武中卒：高祖踐阼，並追封郡王。陳太妃生臨川靖惠王宏，南平元襄王偉。吳太妃生安成康王秀，始興忠武王憺。費太妃生鄱陽忠烈王恢。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0006","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-022-shunzhi-sons-preface-rendered:p001:m0002"}],"interpretation_note":"完整同段太祖十男標題及逐母生子分組；不將生育、夫妻或排行互相替代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001","text":"臨川靖惠王宏字宣達，太祖第六子也。長八尺，美鬚眉，容止可觀。齊永明十年，爲衛軍廬陵王法曹行參軍，遷太子舍人。時長沙王懿鎮梁州，爲魏所圍，明年，給宏精兵千人赴援，未至，魏軍退。遷驃騎晉安王主簿，尋爲北中郎桂陽王功曹史。衡陽王暢，有美名，爲始安王蕭遙光所禮。及遙光作亂，逼暢入東府，暢懼禍，先赴臺。高祖在雍州，常懼諸弟及禍，謂南平王偉曰：「六弟明於事理，必先還臺。」及信至，果如高祖策。","text_sha256":"ff53a5c711a1ae33c0f731a51f828facdd93c709e95fda1310cbc469772c64ca","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true,"first_line":133,"last_line":133,"revision_id":null},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0001","kind":"person","start":0,"end":6,"surface":"臨川靖惠王宏","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"hong"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0002","kind":"person","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"宣達","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"hong_zi"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0003","kind":"person","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"太祖","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_A","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"shunzhi"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0004","kind":"person","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"廬陵王","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_A","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"luling"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0005","kind":"person","start":55,"end":59,"surface":"長沙王懿","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AD","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"yi"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0006","kind":"person","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"宏","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"hong"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0007","kind":"unresolved","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"晉安王","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","source_role":"jinan","resolution_note":"人物官府稱謂可確認，跨篇本名未定：子懋本傳無驃騎、寶義受號在遙光誅後，與此段表面時序有張力；不憑王號選人或捏倒敘。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0008","kind":"person","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"桂陽王","person_id":"